      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for paragraph (1 )(c) the following paragraph: \"(c) admission of a member or subscriber not resident within the limits of a town in Malaysia in which such society proposes to carry on its business: Provided that where a mutual benefit society is established in a particular place of work for the benefit of its members or subscribers, the society shall be entitled to registration notwithstanding that the rules of the society provide for the admission of members or subscribers resident outside the limits of the town in which the society proposes to carry on its business;\"; and"
